Comment: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:29.86,main,IKO,0,0,0,,[OP]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.63,0:00:17.76,main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's been five days \Nsince we left the manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:21.43,main,IKO,0,0,0,,How long does it take to get to \NDirashik, where the magic school is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:24.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,We're still in the Kingdom of Hughlia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:27.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,At this rate, maybe a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:31.42,main,IKO,0,0,0,,That long? It's so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:33.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:36.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But we should be at \NGrandfather's manor soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:40.71,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Say, Iko?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.71,0:00:41.48,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:43.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are you really sure this is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.99,0:00:47.35,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes, this is where we say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.62,0:00:52.07,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'd like to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:57.20,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm already a bit past marriageable age,\Nso it's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.53,0:01:01.90,main,IKO,0,0,0,,If I give up now, I think I'll give up \Non the idea for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.77,0:01:06.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You think I can live on without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:10.85,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Will you marry me then, Master Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.83,0:01:15.47,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Will you leave Princess \NMirika and take me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.41,0:01:20.11,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh, now I can see the manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.21,0:02:59.05,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,FAREWELLS AND HELLOS AND DIRASHIK
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:03:00.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's been four years since\NI came to visit the main family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.02,0:03:03.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Wait, why did I come here four years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:05.53,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:11.43,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Having heard that there \Nwas a huge library here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.43,0:03:16.68,main,IKO,0,0,0,,you thought there might be books on magic \Nand dragged your whole family here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Wait, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:26.31,main - flashback,LITTLE KUNON,0,0,0,,I won't stop dancing until \Nyou say you'll take me there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.65,0:03:28.98,main - flashback,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Darling, listen to Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:31.33,main - flashback,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Fine. I got it, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:32.63,main - flashback,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I'll take you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:38.82,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Back then, you did everything you \Ncould to learn magic, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:40.57,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:45.07,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:47.57,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Grandfather!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:51.33,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,You've grown big!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:54.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I must always be a bigger \Nman than I was yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.39,0:03:56.09,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,Indeed, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.35,0:04:00.01,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,It's been four years. I've missed you so!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:02.74,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,It's so good to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.13,0:04:07.01,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Mother is a hero and Grandfather \Nis a demon lord, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.81,0:04:09.54,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,Is Tinalisa well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:13.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, she's doing so well she \Ncould totally defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:15.27,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,Very good, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:20.03,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,To celebrate your enrollment at the magic \Nschool, I shall buy you anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:21.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:28.41,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Lord Regent. I have a letter \Nfor you from Lady Tinalisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:29.77,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,No need to be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.77,0:04:32.43,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,You want gems? Jewels?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:34.60,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,Let's call a jeweler here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:35.64,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,Someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:39.92,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Lord Regent! Here's a \Nletter from your daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:47.55,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,I must not spend over five \Nhundred thousand necca on Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:49.70,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,It's not a child's allowance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.70,0:04:51.50,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A twelve-year-old is a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:53.75,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Two months of my salary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.75,0:04:55.56,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,It's fine if she doesn't find out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:56.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.11,0:04:59.03,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,What, you want it secretly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:01.82,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,Shall I buy you a large vessel secretly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:05.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No, please send for my new maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:09.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm here so she can take over from Iko.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:11.61,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:13.43,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,I'll go get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:19.29,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I'm Rinko Round! I'm eighteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:23.22,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I applied for this job because \Nthe pay wasn't too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.22,0:05:25.18,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I want to open my own store in the future
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:28.47,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,and also save up for wedding expenses, \Nso I agreed to this position!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.31,0:05:31.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Well, um... Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:33.60,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're Iko's little sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:37.51,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Yes. My sister recommended this job to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.51,0:05:40.69,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,By the way, I already have \Na fiancé, unlike her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:42.11,main,IKO,0,0,0,,You want me to beat you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:43.88,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.88,0:05:46.29,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I'm saying I'm not open to \Nbeing contracted as a mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:48.26,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.26,0:05:50.40,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I have a fiancée as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:54.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,so you should cherish your fiancé \Nmore than the three mealtimes of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:55.50,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.87,0:05:58.50,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Wait, my mealtimes...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:05:59.71,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You don't want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:01.54,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I will do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:04.79,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,We promised that we'd \Nopen the store together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.79,0:06:07.13,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,And I need money for that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:09.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You two are alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:13.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I was worried you might not \Nget my sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.89,0:06:17.55,main,IKO,0,0,0,,People have called us lively \Nsisters since we were small.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.86,0:06:19.90,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Looking forward to serving you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.84,0:06:22.44,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,They do look alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:27.40,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I was nervous since you told me \Nhe was the scion of a marquis
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:29.86,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,and a sorcerer with a Hero's Scar,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:31.45,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,but he seems easygoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:35.18,main,IKO,0,0,0,,When he's focused on magic, \Nhe forgets to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.18,0:06:38.88,main,IKO,0,0,0,,So make him sandwiches so \Nhe can eat while he studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:41.96,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,His favorite sandwiches are Hamburg \Nsteak and bacon, you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:44.42,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes. And milk tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:47.13,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Ask if he wants it without \Nmilk or without tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:50.72,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Oh, I know I'll get along just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.35,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:56.66,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,You want me to attend Master Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:58.61,main - flashback,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Your reputation precedes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:00.85,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,What?! Am I famous?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:03.26,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,Will I get swarmed by suitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:05.57,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm still young and I'm not ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:07.36,main - flashback,ARSAN,0,0,0,,That's what we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:12.61,main - flashback,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I thought he could use someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:18.14,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:21.10,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,My name is Iko, and I will be \Ntaking care of you starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.86,0:07:22.75,main - flashback,KUNON,0,0,0,,Iko?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:23.87,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:29.01,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,That's lettuce.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.29,0:07:30.31,main - flashback,KUNON,0,0,0,,Lettuce?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:32.12,main - flashback,KUNON,0,0,0,,And what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:33.39,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,It's mustard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:35.52,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,Wow, so dashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:40.68,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, perhaps {\i1}you{\i0} were the \Nmodel for the classic storybook prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:44.21,main - flashback,KUNON,0,0,0,,Alas, my true identity has been revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:46.34,main - flashback,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for not telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:50.57,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,Plus, you'll be perfectly\N fine on your own now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:52.42,main - flashback,KUNON,0,0,0,,I won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.84,0:07:57.66,main - flashback,KUNON,0,0,0,,Miss Jenié left me, Lady Flora left me, \Nand if you leave me, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.21,0:08:01.13,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Rinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:01.91,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:04.19,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon is still a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:07.60,main,IKO,0,0,0,,He's earnest and listens \Nto people around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:10.17,main,IKO,0,0,0,,So I'm telling you, if you put \Nany weird ideas in his head,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:11.42,main,IKO,0,0,0,,you'll have me to answer to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:14.55,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'll beat you up if you \Nteach him anything naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:16.60,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Anything naughty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:17.93,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Like chasing skirts?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.93,0:08:19.72,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Stop it! I don't want to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:22.30,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon is the sweetest angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.30,0:08:26.93,main,IKO,0,0,0,,And if some random cunning, dingy \Nwench comes in contact with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.93,0:08:29.11,main,IKO,0,0,0,,No, I can't stand the thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:32.67,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Princess Mirika is the only one who \Nis allowed to touch him as a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.67,0:08:34.86,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Only Princess Mirika!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:37.07,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.07,0:08:39.12,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I'll watch out for his \Nrelationships with women.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:43.88,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,But you know, Master Kunon is a \Ngentleman, so he's kind to women.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:46.80,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,He almost always speaks to them \Nand gives them compliments,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:50.05,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,so he's just an easy target \Nfor women, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.35,0:08:52.47,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Why do you describe him so terribly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.47,0:08:55.18,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Because that's what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.57,0:08:58.93,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I mean, it only follows that \Nhe'll become a womanizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.93,0:09:01.71,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Stop it! Master Kunon would never do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:02.68,main,IKO,0,0,0,,He's an angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.68,0:09:04.72,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Come on, let's be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:06.03,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Why are you so obsessed—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:06.84,main,IKO,0,0,0,,He won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:09.19,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon would never!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.94,0:09:12.07,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Mmm, it's tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.07,0:09:13.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Especially this bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:16.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Smoked by the warmth and \Nlove of you two sisters,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.73,0:09:20.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I feel like even I'm getting \Nsmokey and aromatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.71,0:09:21.98,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,See what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:23.08,main,IKO,0,0,0,,He will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:37.84,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Good morning, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:39.54,main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's time for your departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.90,0:09:40.57,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:42.76,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Iko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:43.49,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:47.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Do you remember what I said after \NMiss Jenié and Lady Flora quit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:50.98,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That I'd never be fine if you left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:53.19,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:56.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm away from \NFather, Mother, Big Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:10:01.86,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,the Royal Sorcerers, and my master...\Nnot to mention Princess Mirika.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:06.76,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And now I'll be away from you \Nand go to the magic school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.76,0:10:09.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But this is what I wanted \Nand decided for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.27,0:10:11.21,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.43,0:10:16.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You'll be away from me, but we're \Nonly apart. You won't be gone. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.09,0:10:19.29,main,IKO,0,0,0,,That's right. You can see \Nme when you come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.29,0:10:23.10,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I will continue this work in \NHughlia after I get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:25.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It'll be a few years until I see you next.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:29.72,main,IKO,0,0,0,,By then, I may have a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:31.61,main,IKO,0,0,0,,An adorable child like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:38.11,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Please take care, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.35,0:10:40.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything, Iko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:51.38,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,Are you sure you must go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:53.88,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,You don't have to, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:56.62,main,EDREW,0,0,0,,Why don't you live here with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.62,0:10:57.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Start the carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.53,0:11:01.14,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:02.26,main - top,EDREW,0,0,0,,Kunon, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:04.66,main - top,EDREW,0,0,0,,Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:10.74,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Are you sure it was fine to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:13.78,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,The lord regent was still \Nsaying something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:16.60,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If I respond, it will only \Ntake longer, so it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.91,0:11:20.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Anyhow, thank you for coming \Nto work for me, Rinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:22.78,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,It's my pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.02,0:11:26.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your fiancé will have to wait for \Nseveral years. Are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:32.43,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Yes! He said he'd wait, since it \Nwas to make money for our store.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.75,0:11:34.54,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What kind of store is it going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:37.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A shady business of sweeping \Npeople under the rug?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.37,0:11:39.80,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I did think about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:41.53,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,but I decided on a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:45.34,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I like eating, and they're kind of \Nthe same thing. Plus, it's legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.34,0:11:48.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're right. The only difference is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:51.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,sustaining people with food or \Ngetting rid of them in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:55.01,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,A new life begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.45,0:11:58.45,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I'm starting everything anew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:01.49,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,And I will meet new people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:04.14,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yeah, this isn't too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:14.29,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Wow, so many magic stores!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:16.13,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Because it's close to Dirashik.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:20.88,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Which means Dirashik is a \Nnation of amazing magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:34.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are all these books on magic? Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:38.13,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,The lord regent's library was way bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:40.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But didn't have a lot of books on magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:43.50,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I've only read a handful so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:45.11,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Would you like to buy some now, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:47.12,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,We'll end up on the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.37,0:12:49.45,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,What? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:51.97,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,5 MILLION NECCA
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.18,0:12:51.97,main - shifted,SIGN,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.97,0:12:53.63,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,What is this price?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.63,0:12:58.17,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,The book alone can cover a store for me \Nand my fiancé, plus a branch store!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:13:00.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Magic books are one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:03.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's why each book costs a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.34,0:13:04.47,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,It's too expensive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:06.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Rinko, you shouldn't be \Ntoo loud in a store—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:07.84,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,Are you a sorcerer, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:11.47,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,A student at the magic \Nschool by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.91,0:13:13.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm an applicant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.42,0:13:15.62,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,Can you use magic, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:16.67,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,What attribute?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:17.50,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.50,0:13:19.30,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,Show me, show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.30,0:13:22.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Sure, if it's a request from a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:24.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:28.82,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,Wow, so tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.82,0:13:29.83,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:31.03,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.03,0:13:33.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.02,0:13:34.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are you a sorcerer as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.51,0:13:40.41,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,No, I just love magic, and I really \Nwanted to work in the field of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.41,0:13:42.43,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,I guess I'm a magic enthusiast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.43,0:13:44.55,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,My gosh, today is my day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:47.90,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,To meet a sorcerer who can \Nuse such adorable spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.29,0:13:51.09,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,Dirashik is intense these days, \Nso best of luck to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.09,0:13:52.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Intense?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:57.69,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,Yeah. This year, the saint of the \NHoly Kingdom is enrolling as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.21,0:13:59.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The Saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:04.12,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,Last year, they had the Inferno Prince and \NLightning Bolt of the New Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:06.28,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,And now you're joining them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:08.07,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,You'll be so famous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.07,0:14:11.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:13.25,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:20.38,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,I just got a secondhand grimoire of the \Nmost popular sorcerer, Zeonly Finroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.38,0:14:22.34,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,I'll give you a special discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:23.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, no thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:24.84,main,STAFF,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:29.09,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,MUMBLE MUMBLE MUMBLE MUMBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:29.09,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,This single book is worth \Nmy store, my dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:32.98,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I didn't realize it would \Nshock you that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.98,0:14:34.37,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Of course it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:38.62,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,By the way, that grimoire \Nreally was a great bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:39.48,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:44.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's fine. I know the contents, and \Nit's most likely the clean copy I made.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.48,0:14:45.48,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:47.95,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What should I check out next?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:15:03.04,main - italics,STORE OWNER/I,0,0,0,,Oh no. This well-dressed child \Nwith a maid came into the store,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:05.36,main - italics,STORE OWNER/I,0,0,0,,and now he's touching the merchandise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.76,main - italics,STORE OWNER/I,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:09.27,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.71,0:15:12.51,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,Excuse me, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.89,0:15:15.47,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.94,0:15:14.51,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.47,0:15:17.77,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,A veggie thief will hang, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.65,0:15:20.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Rinko, this is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:21.64,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}not{\i0} great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:24.77,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing? \NStop touching my merchandise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.77,0:15:26.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, please pay me no mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.23,0:15:28.57,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,I have to! I can't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:31.08,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I was trying to memorize the texture.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.40,0:15:36.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Simple words like "cloth" and \N"fur" can cover diverse textures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:37.83,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,Texture?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:40.07,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What fur is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.07,0:15:41.58,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,It's dark fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:45.45,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,It's very rare, so please do not touch it—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:45.45,main - top,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:48.72,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,A dark fox?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:52.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I should have asked for \Nyour permission before I did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.97,0:15:57.94,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,You can reproduce animals \Nwith magic? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.60,0:16:04.42,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,Can you reproduce anything \Nif you know the texture?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:07.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. Reproducing only \Nshape and texture, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:10.49,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,Then... what about a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.49,0:16:12.74,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,The hell are you suggesting to a child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:15.45,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:19.97,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Sorry isn't gonna cut it, tainting \Nprecious Master Kunon's ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:22.57,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Reproducing a human is \Ntoo complicated, so no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.57,0:16:24.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And I get yelled at so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:26.75,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Let's go, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.75,0:16:28.71,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,This store is for trashy adults!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:30.13,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.13,0:16:31.51,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,I only asked on impulse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.51,0:16:33.50,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,I-I have a crush on this lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:35.57,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,and I gave into the temptation \Nthat maybe I could lay with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.57,0:16:36.94,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Shut your piehole!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:40.06,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,You'll taint Master Kunon's heart, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:43.59,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,This town is bad for your education!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.59,0:16:45.65,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Let us hurry to Dirashik!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:48.19,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,When you're mad, you're scarier than Iko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:52.45,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,What did I utter toward a child...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:55.82,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.22,0:17:01.58,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,Wonderful to see you, Your Reverence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:05.83,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I've been told that you have \Na rare scarf made of dark fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.83,0:17:07.08,main,REYES,0,0,0,,May I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:11.81,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,A dark fox?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.81,0:17:14.09,main,JIRNI,0,0,0,,I thought they didn't like humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.09,0:17:16.71,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,Oh, this? This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.71,0:17:18.10,main,REYES,0,0,0,,It's a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:25.98,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry. I didn't \Nexpect it to be water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:29.09,main,JIRNI,0,0,0,,That dark fox was water?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:31.52,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,Water attribute magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.52,0:17:32.61,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.61,0:17:33.18,main,JIRNI,0,0,0,,Do not move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.18,0:17:34.86,main,STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.86,0:17:39.50,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,The way it burst, it seemed it was \Nmade with small amount of magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:41.87,main - italics,STORE OWNER/I,0,0,0,,That child and now these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:44.87,main - italics,STORE OWNER/I,0,0,0,,What kind of torturous day is it today?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:48.52,main - italics,REYES/I,0,0,0,,It's a spell outside of my knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.27,0:17:52.33,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.40,0:18:03.77,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,We're in Dirashik, Master Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.10,0:18:04.92,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:09.19,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm finally here at the magic school!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.65,0:18:14.74,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,You must be tired from the \Nlong journey, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.74,0:18:17.34,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Please rest well today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.34,0:18:19.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. Same to you, Rinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.84,0:18:22.77,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, you'll \Nlive in a dorm, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:26.80,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Basically, all students at the \Nmagic school will live in the dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.80,0:18:30.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If we ask, an attendant \Ncan live with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:37.00,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but the dorm is full\Nand there's no vacancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:38.17,main,KUNON/RINKO,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.51,0:18:43.64,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,The application for the \Ndorm is long past due.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:45.81,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,You didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.81,0:18:49.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Master never mentioned that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.99,0:19:00.97,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,What a bold entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:03.89,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Was it meant to shock me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:06.78,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Or are you here to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.78,0:19:09.96,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I need to speak to you. Urgently.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.39,0:19:12.73,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,It's about my beloved student.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.50,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.50,0:19:18.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.94,0:19:20.81,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Would you like to stay at a hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.81,0:19:23.09,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,The funds from your family can cover that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:28.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hmm. Since I'll be here for several \Nyears while attending the magic school,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.49,0:19:31.19,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,can I rent a house for longer stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:34.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sure there will be expenses \Nfor magic-related stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.09,0:19:36.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,so I'd like to save where I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:41.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What do you think? Rent a \Nsmall house and live together?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.11,0:19:43.74,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,What?! Is this a proposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:45.63,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.74,0:19:50.08,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Information on real estate agents?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:53.75,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,We give it out to the applicants \Nwho couldn't get into the dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.99,0:19:56.32,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,The real estate agents on that list
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.32,0:19:59.72,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,can show you some \Nnice properties for sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:00.76,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:10.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A life for just the two of us begins!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.28,0:20:15.54,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:24.53,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,I've brought the list \Nof incoming students.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.69,0:20:29.08,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,I hear we have the cream \Nof the crop this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:33.17,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Yes. Some are eligible \Nfor the Advanced class.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.27,0:20:37.04,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:40.22,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Apparently he's a student of Zeonly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.39,0:20:44.93,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Hm. That man took a student, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.67,0:20:48.02,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.39,0:20:54.27,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,ENTRANCE EXAM CHECK-IN
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:54.27,main - shifted,SIGN,0,0,0,,I can't enter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.57,0:21:00.14,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,Right. No one can enter except for the \Nstudents and authorized people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.45,0:21:04.65,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Would this help, by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.65,0:21:06.41,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,No, it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.18,0:21:10.52,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,Please watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:12.25,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:15.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You look strict, but you're \Nactually very kind, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.59,0:21:16.53,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,"My lady"...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.53,0:21:17.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.73,0:21:20.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't know what to call you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.84,0:21:23.76,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,but not having a name is also tantalizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.17,0:21:26.11,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,Not having a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.11,0:21:28.26,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,I have a name, and it's Loubella... oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.53,0:21:30.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What a beautiful name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.51,0:21:32.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The sounds of "lou" and "bella" \Nare especially excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.81,0:21:36.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,As if you took "lou" and \N"bella" and put them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.87,0:21:40.02,main - italics,LOUBELLA/I,0,0,0,,The maid was something else, \Nbut this child is also...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.39,0:21:43.97,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,Please wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.04,0:21:49.27,main - italics,REYES/I,0,0,0,,An eyepatch?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.27,0:21:50.25,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,An eyepatch?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.25,0:21:51.33,main - italics,HANK/I,0,0,0,,And a cane.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.53,0:21:54.46,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,This is exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:40.25,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,NEXT EPISODE: THE ADVANCED CLASS
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.96,0:23:38.54,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next episode: "The Advanced Class."
